Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 15:25:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Add invites table and model

An invite asks an email address to join a team with a role. It carries
a token, an expiry and a status. A partial unique index allows one
pending invite per address per team.

email_queued_at is unused for now: the email sweep fills it in.
